  "statement": "# Manifest Run — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nRead a set of delivery commitments, plan a route through a small city, drive it under time pressure, and finish the manifest.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA bounded 3D delivery-routing game with multiple destinations or orders, meaningful route choice, success/failure, and replay.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the city topology, order rules, timing, camera options, and vehicle feel.\n"
